# A host-built site bundle must never enter the build context: the image's
# bundles (the OS shell and the VS Code landing page, memql#5518) are produced
# by the Dockerfile's own spa stage, from source, and a stale dist/ copied in
# would be indistinguishable from a fresh one. The page's browser-test
# screenshots are review evidence, not source.
